    {
      "id": "claim_154f6831a8f1438391afb1dccea677b1",
      "statement": "MergePRDialog opens a second \"Merge Conflict Detected\" dialog when the merge endpoint's error string contains 'conflict' or 'mergeable' (the two strings the server emits for GitHub 409 and 405). The \"Fix with Agent\" action posts to /api/tasks/:taskId/continue with a fixed follow-up message asking the agent to resolve conflicts and push the result, after which the user re-clicks Merge PR. This is the only place the continue endpoint is invoked from a button rather than from a user-typed chat message.",
