      "id": "claim_29944258059d480f8ff1bac716d83548",
      "statement": "PRCheckStatus (the sidebar overlay that wraps PRStatusIcon) fetches /api/tasks/:taskId/check-runs on mount and re-polls every 30 seconds, then renders a color-coded dot with a deliberate failure-first priority: failure/cancelled conclusions take precedence over in_progress/queued indicators, so a failing check is never masked by a passing sibling. The component renders nothing for non-open PRs, while loading, or when the check-runs array is empty.",
