    {
      "id": "claim_7bd02659070043fc802e10313cfdce12",
      "statement": "The mergePullRequest helper in lib/github/client.ts translates GitHub API status codes to domain messages used by the conflict dialog: 405 → 'Pull request is not mergeable', 409 → 'Merge conflict - cannot auto-merge', 403 → 'Permission denied. Check repository access', 404 → 'Pull request not found'. The MergePRDialog client treats the substrings 'conflict' and 'mergeable' in any error string as the trigger to flip to the Fix with Agent dialog.",
