    {
      "id": "claim_c2b0acafed4c41aa867a4899b675b0c5",
      "statement": "The task page runs POST /api/tasks/:taskId/sync-pr on mount whenever task.prStatus is 'open' or null, so that a PR the user merged or closed on github.com while away from the page gets reconciled to the row (and, if observed as merged, gets completedAt set). The response triggers refreshTasks() whenever the returned status differs from the local prStatus, so the sidebar and overview bar update within the same polling cycle.",
